Error [E2305]: View field `values` cannot be assigned a new source
  --> stored_view_field_cannot_be_rebound_to_different_owner.jet:7:12
    |
  7 |     holder.values = second
    |            ^^^^^^
 Why: A stored view field has one stabilized owner relationship; overwriting it would erase or change that public provenance
 Fix: Construct a new value with the new view, or keep the original field source unchanged
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2305
